  "id": "vectors-test",
  "title": "Field boundary tiles 2025 (test)",
  "description": "TEST collection \u2014 candidate replacement for the global field-boundary PMTiles. Two single-archive renderings of the 2025 [Fields of the World](https://fieldsofthe.world) PRUE predictions (~600M field polygons), built with geoparquet-io (A5 aggregation) and tylertoo (tiling). `fields-2025-thinned.pmtiles` runs the raw polygons through tylertoo's generalization ladder from z0. `fields-2025-aggregate.pmtiles` shows A5 grid-cell aggregates at low zooms (`cells` layer: resolution 5 at z0\u20135, 8 from z6 \u2014 per-cell `count`, `sum_area`, `avg_area`, `max_area`, `avg_confidence`) handing over to the unthinned field polygons (`fields` layer, 2 MB tile cap) at z9. Styles cover field count, coverage, average/largest field size and model confidence. The A5 cell aggregates are also published as GeoParquet (cells_r8.parquet, cells_r5.parquet); the raw field polygons live in the main vectors collection.",
  "license": "CC-BY-4.0",
